Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userName": "kim1234",
  "password": "pas",
  "nickName": "철수"
}

### 회원가입
POST http://localhost:8080/auth/signup
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userName": "kim1234",
  "password": "password123",
  "nickName": "철수"
}

### 로그인 - 성공 (200 + Set-Cookie)
POST http://localhost:8080/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userName": "kim1234",
  "password": "password123"
}

### 로그인 - 비번 틀림 (401)
POST http://localhost:8080/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userName": "kim1234",
  "password": "wrong-password"
}

### 로그인 - 없는 아이디 (401)
POST http://localhost:8080/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userName": "nobody",
  "password": "password123"
}

### 로그인 - 빈칸 (400)
POST http://localhost:8080/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userName": "",
  "password": ""
}

